{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hallowed Core is a story-driven turn-based RPG inspired by classic RPG's such as Chrono Trigger, Final Fantasy 6, and Golden Sun. In this hollow-earth setting, the surface is but a legend. Foretold to someday return, the people of the core await the chosen one, prophesied to arrive in a time of turmoil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The war between the fire-wielders of Granlest and the water wielders of Sylvestria rages on. In the midst of battle, a chance encounter sets forth a chain of events that will change the Core forever. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The planet stirs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;Alpha&quot; draws near.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Character arcs with visible development</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A rich world filled with lore and history</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Unique elemental combat system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Deep themes of inheritance and responsibility</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Completely original soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Emotional stakes with endearing characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a free demo containing the first of four chapters of the Hallowed Core Game. Upcoming chapters will be released as the are developed, dates TBD.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3927600?t=1754604583","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3927600?t=1754604583","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927600/aab85315203178a8bea520297cd14825874ee178/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754604583","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927600/aab85315203178a8bea520297cd14825874ee178/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754604583","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hallowed Core is a story-driven turn-based RPG inspired by classic RPG's such as Chrono Trigger, Final Fantasy 6, and Golden Sun. In this hollow-earth setting, the surface is but a legend. Foretold to someday return, the people of the core await the chosen one, prophesied to arrive in a time of turmoil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The war between the fire-wielders of Granlest and the water wielders of Sylvestria rages on. In the midst of battle, a chance encounter sets forth a chain of events that will change the Core forever. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The planet stirs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;Alpha&quot; draws near.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Character arcs with visible development</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A rich world filled with lore and history</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Unique elemental combat system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Deep themes of inheritance and responsibility</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Completely original soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Emotional stakes with endearing characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a free demo containing the first of four chapters of the Hallowed Core Game. Upcoming chapters will be released as the are developed, dates TBD.</p>","developers":["Pyxis Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"d